-| 6 | Attributes added: `@deterministic`, `@hot_reload`, `@always_specialize`, `@never_specialize`, and `deterministic` as an argument of `@ffi`. Codes added: `E2220`–`E2223`, `E4070`–`E4073`, `E9030`–`E9034`, `W2220`, `W9030`, `L2004`. | V §8, XX.6 |
