+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| integers, `int` | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | 0 | ✓ | ✓ |
+| floats, `float` | ✓ | ✓ | IEEE `==` | totalOrder | — | 0.0 | ✓ | ✓ |
+| `bool` | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | `false < true` | ✓ | `false` | ✓ | ✓ |
+| `char` | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | by scalar value | ✓ | `'\0'` | ✓ | ✓ |
+| `void` | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | `()` | — | ✓ |
+| `str` | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | by bytes | ✓ | `""` | ✓ | ✓ |
+| `String` | ✓ | — | ✓ | by bytes | ✓ | empty | ✓ | ✓ |
+| tuples, `[T; N]` | if all | if all | if all | lexicographic, if all | if all | if all | if all `Debug` | if all |
